event: baseline
data: {"plan":{"move":[],"description":"No change: keep the current setup","variant_facts":"The merchandise under consideration is a Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257. It features two fan speeds and a variable temperature control dial and is rated at 1500 watts. The main components are a plastic molded housing that encompasses a heating element, motor-fan assembly, power switch and power cord. It delivers hot air for heat shrinking, stripping paint, bending plastic, drying and thawing. The Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257 is assembled in Thailand using components sourced from Thailand and China.\n\nThe main housing, front cover and heating element are produced in Thailand. The electric motor, fan, motor support, printed circuit board assembly (PCBA), switch, power cord, wiring, knob, back cover and support ring, heat insulator and fasteners are sourced from China. \n\nFinal assembly in Thailand: press fit the fan to the motor spindle and attach the fan cover; crimp plugs to the heating element wires, add heat shrink tubing, solder wires to the switch and plug the heating element into the switch and PCBA; fasten the PCBA to the main housing, assemble the temperature knob, connect the PCBA to the motor, add the back cover and motor support; secure the power cord, add the switch slider, close the housing with screws, test, label and pack.\n","prediction":{"origin_country":"Thailand","key_factors":["Heating element and main housing"],"decisive_step":"Production of the heating element and main housing combined with final assembly in Thailand","confidence":0.75,"reasoning":"A heat gun's primary function is generating and directing intense heat. The heating element, which imparts the essential character alongside the motor/fan, is manufactured in Thailand, as are the main housing and front cover. While the motor, fan, and PCBA are from China, the fabrication of the core heating component and housing in Thailand, combined with final electoral integration, soldering, and assembly in Thailand, substantially transforms the components into a finished heat gun of Thai origin.","cited_rulings":[],"precedents":["N335508","N340187","N342124","N348083","N351782"],"trace":{"llm_provider":"litellm","model_id":"gemini-4-argon","prompt_version":"engine-v1","input_tokens":2782,"output_tokens":197,"latency_ms":1030}},"duty_effect_per_year":0,"added_cost_per_year":0,"net_per_year":0,"shown":false}}

