data: {"done":2,"key":"motor_fan_assembly@th","plan":{"move":[{"group":"motor_fan_assembly","to_plant":"th"}],"description":"Make Motor-fan assembly in Thailand","variant_facts":"The merchandise under consideration is a Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257. It features two fan speeds and a variable temperature control dial and is rated at 1500 watts. The main components are a plastic molded housing that encompasses a heating element, motor-fan assembly, power switch and power cord. It delivers hot air for heat shrinking, stripping paint, bending plastic, drying and thawing. The Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257 is assembled in Thailand using components sourced from Thailand and China.\n\nThe main housing, front cover, heating element, electric motor, fan and motor support are produced in Thailand. The printed circuit board assembly (PCBA), switch, power cord, wiring, knob, back cover and support ring, heat insulator and fasteners are sourced from China. \n\nIn Thailand, the electric motor, fan and motor support will be produced in-house: stamp rotor laminations from silicon steel; stack laminations and wind the rotor; build the stator; assemble the motor; press-fit the fan to the motor spindle.\n\nFinal assembly in Thailand: press fit the fan to the motor spindle and attach the fan cover; crimp plugs to the heating element wires, add heat shrink tubing, solder wires to the switch and plug the heating element into the switch and PCBA; fasten the PCBA to the main housing, assemble the temperature knob, connect the PCBA to the motor, add the back cover and motor support; secure the power cord, add the switch slider, close the housing with screws, test, label and pack.\n","prediction":{"origin_country":"Thailand","key_factors":["Heating element, electric motor, and fan assembly"],"decisive_step":"Production of the heating element, electric motor (stamping, winding), and fan, plus final assembly in Thailand","confidence":0.95,"reasoning":"The core components that impart the essential character of a heat gun—the heating element, electric motor, and fan—are manufactured in Thailand (including complex motor stamping and winding). Additionally, the main housing is produced in Thailand, where all components are finally assembled into the finished heat gun. Consistent with N351782 and N348083, origin is conferred by the country producing the primary functional components (heating and motorized airflow mechanisms), which here is Thailand.","cited_rulings":["N348083","N351782"],"precedents":["N340187","N342124","N348083","N351782","N351922"],"trace":{"llm_provider":"litellm","model_id":"gemini-4-argon","prompt_version":"engine-v1","input_tokens":2788,"output_tokens":217,"latency_ms":1241}},"verdict":{"precedent_supported":true,"supporting_ruling":"H317645","confidence":0.75,"reasoning":"In Variant A (N328954), origin was China because although the heating element, housing, and final assembly were in Thailand, the other core functional components (electric motor, fan, and PCBA) were from China. In Variant B, full production of the electric motor (stamping laminations, winding rotor, building stator, assembling motor) and fan moves to Thailand. With both core functional subassemblies of a heat gun (the heating element and the motor-fan assembly), plus the housing and final assembly, now produced in Thailand, only the PCBA and minor parts remain Chinese, shifting the country of origin to Thailand.","trace":{"llm_provider":"litellm","model_id":"gemini-4-argon","prompt_version":"verifier-v1+known-a","input_tokens":5127,"output_tokens":370,"latency_ms":0}},"duty_effect_per_year":500000,"added_cost_per_year":120000,"net_per_year":380000,"shown":false,"rejection_reason":"precedent-supported but verifier confidence 0.75 is below 0.95","rejection_kind":"below_confidence_bar"},"total":6}

