data: {"done":4,"key":"motor_fan_assembly@th+switch_cord_minor_parts@th","plan":{"move":[{"group":"motor_fan_assembly","to_plant":"th"},{"group":"switch_cord_minor_parts","to_plant":"th"}],"description":"Make Motor-fan assembly and Switch, cord and minor parts in Thailand","variant_facts":"The merchandise under consideration is a Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257. It features two fan speeds and a variable temperature control dial and is rated at 1500 watts. The main components are a plastic molded housing that encompasses a heating element, motor-fan assembly, power switch and power cord. It delivers hot air for heat shrinking, stripping paint, bending plastic, drying and thawing. The Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257 is assembled in Thailand using components sourced from Thailand and China.\n\nThe main housing, front cover, heating element, electric motor, fan, motor support, switch, power cord, wiring, knob, back cover and support ring, heat insulator and fasteners are produced in Thailand. The printed circuit board assembly (PCBA) are sourced from China. \n\nIn Thailand, the electric motor, fan and motor support will be produced in-house: stamp rotor laminations from silicon steel; stack laminations and wind the rotor; build the stator; assemble the motor; press-fit the fan to the motor spindle.\n\nIn Thailand, the switch, power cord, wiring, knob, back cover and support ring, heat insulator and fasteners will be produced in-house: make the switch, power cord, wiring, supports and fasteners.\n\nFinal assembly in Thailand: press fit the fan to the motor spindle and attach the fan cover; crimp plugs to the heating element wires, add heat shrink tubing, solder wires to the switch and plug the heating element into the switch and PCBA; fasten the PCBA to the main housing, assemble the temperature knob, connect the PCBA to the motor, add the back cover and motor support; secure the power cord, add the switch slider, close the housing with screws, test, label and pack.\n","prediction":{"origin_country":"Thailand","key_factors":["Heating element, electric motor, and fan assembly"],"decisive_step":"Manufacturing of the electric motor, heating element, and fan, along with final assembly of the heat gun in Thailand","confidence":0.98,"reasoning":"Nearly all key functional components of the heat gun—specifically the heating element, electric motor (stamped, wound, and assembled from silicon steel), fan, switch, and housing—are manufactured in Thailand. Only the PCBA is sourced from China. Similar to N351782, where the manufacture of the motor and fan blades imparted the essential character, the production of the core heating and air-moving components and final assembly in Thailand substantially transform the Chinese PCBA into a new article of commerce.","cited_rulings":["N351782"],"precedents":["N340187","N342124","N348083","N351782","N351922"],"trace":{"llm_provider":"litellm","model_id":"gemini-4-argon","prompt_version":"engine-v1","input_tokens":2833,"output_tokens":232,"latency_ms":1047}},"verdict":{"precedent_supported":true,"supporting_ruling":"N325810","confidence":0.9,"reasoning":"In Variant A (N328954), the heat gun is of Chinese origin because the electric motor, fan, PCBA, switch, power cord, and other components are sourced from China, while only the housing, front cover, and heating element are produced in Thailand. In Variant B, virtually every component—including the electric motor (stamping rotor laminations, winding the rotor, building the stator, assembling), fan, switch, power cord, wiring, housing, and heating element—is manufactured in Thailand, leaving only the PCBA sourced from China. Under CBP precedent (e.g., N325810), producing the motor core and virtually all functional components in Thailand shifts origin to Thailand.","trace":{"llm_provider":"litellm","model_id":"gemini-4-argon","prompt_version":"verifier-v1+known-a","input_tokens":7496,"output_tokens":397,"latency_ms":0}},"duty_effect_per_year":500000,"added_cost_per_year":155000,"net_per_year":345000,"shown":false,"rejection_reason":"precedent-supported but verifier confidence 0.90 is below 0.95","rejection_kind":"below_confidence_bar"},"total":6}

